              "explain": "Include the conjugate root.",
              "work": "The roots are \\(3,2+i,2-i\\)."
            },
            {
              "explain": "Write the factorisation and multiply.",
              "work": "\\(P(z)=(z-3)(z-(2+i))(z-(2-i))=(z-3)((z-2)^2+1).\\)"
            },
            {
              "explain": "Expand and identify the matching option.",
              "work": "\\((z-3)(z^2-4z+5)=z^3-7z^2+17z-15.\\)"
            }
          ],
          "xp": 1,
